        "it": "Regali davanti alla porta",
        "en": "Presents at the door"
      },
      "band": 750,
      "blurb": "In the little town of Spello, Elena keeps finding other people's things outside her bookshop each morning, and the neighbours start to wonder who is taking them."
    },
    {
      "id": "una-settimana-a-bologna",
      "title": {
        "it": "Una settimana a Bologna",
        "en": "A week in Bologna"
      },
      "band": 750,
      "blurb": "Kate, a young Irish woman, spends a week in Bologna and gets by in Italian: a room, a dinner, a doctor, a lost phone and two new friends."
    },
    {
