      "title": {
        "it": "Appuntamenti",
        "en": "Appointments"
      },
      "band": 1000,
      "blurb": "Davide has just moved to Turin and knows nobody. One errand at a time (the doctor, the bank, the post office, the barber, a call to his landlord) the city starts to feel like home."
    },
    {
      "id": "feste-italiane",
      "title": {
        "it": "Feste italiane",
        "en": "Italian holidays"
      },
      "band": 1000,
      "blurb": "A year of Italian traditions through the Moretti family of Bologna: Christmas and the Befana, Carnevale, Easter and Pasquetta, Ferragosto, and the weekly feast of Sunday lunch."
    },
    {
