        "en": "When I was little"
      },
      "band": 1000,
      "blurb": "Nonna Rita tells her granddaughter Chiara about growing up in a Puglia village in the 1960s: the one-room school, the family's olive trees, a first job, the first television and a boy with a chair."
    },
