    },
    {
      "id": "lettere-da-lontano",
      "title": {
        "it": "Lettere da lontano",
        "en": "Letters from far away"
      },
      "band": 3000,
      "blurb": "Nicola has moved to Melbourne, Valentina has stayed in Turin: five long emails between two old school friends about work, missing home, love, a father's illness and the question of whether to come back."
